a-Wall-Faced-Bidette---Gloss-Tortora_FUT005-TO","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut005-to","label":"Gloss Tortora"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Bidette---Gloss-Burnt-Sienna_FUT005-BS","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut005-bs","label":"Gloss Burnt Sienna"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Bidette---Gloss-Petrol_FUT005-PT","selected":true,"targetId":"sku-fut005-pt","label":"Gloss Petrol"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Bidette---Gloss-Sugar-Paper_FUT005-SP","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut005-sp","label":"Gloss Sugar Paper"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Futura-Wall-Faced-Bidette---Gloss-Indigo_FUT005-IN","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-fut005-in","label":"Gloss Indigo"}],"tapHoles":[]},"descriptionHtml":"<div><div><div>Introducing Futura, the latest evolution in bathroom design from Italian manufacturer Hatria. Winner of multiple international design awards, Futura embodies purity in form and function.</div><div>With its pared-back silhouette and refined geometry, Futura presents an almost sculptural clarity —free from visible outlets or unnecessary detail. Designed not to draw attention, it elevates the spatial experience through quiet innovation, refined engineering, and modern minimalism.</div><div>The Futura Faced Bidette is designed as a companion to the <a href=\"#/product/sku-fut002\">Futura Wall Faced Pan</a>  ensuring consistency in proportion, projection and alignment across the suite.</div><div>Wall faced installation allows for a clean junction with the floor and simplified maintenance.</div></div></div>","sourceRecordCount":1,"captureDate":"2026-11-01","availability":null}
